meta {
  name: Space Unregister Notify
  type: http
  seq: 161
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/xrpc/com.atproto.space.unregisterNotify
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "space": "at://{{did}}/space/org.example.bucket/main",
    "service": "did:web:syncer.example.com#atproto_space_syncer"
  }
}

docs {
  Withdraw a registerNotify subscription. Idempotent: succeeds whether or not a matching
  registration existed, so a syncer tearing itself down need not know what it still holds.
  Registrations also lapse on their own at the expiry registerNotify returned, so this is for
  explicit withdrawal rather than cleanup.

  Answered only by the space's authority (400 SpaceNotFound otherwise). Auth: a space
  credential, or the authority's own session.
}
